    "Scan of the 1948 edition of the Salem, New Jersey, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the Department of Commerce. Surveyed in 1947; aerial photographs from 1983; field checked in 1948; photo revised in 1986; last revised in 1993; printed in 1993.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 27 inches. Printed projection: Transverse Mercator; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
